  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "PNB LUXURA Credit Card is a premium offering on RuPay EKAA network which comes with luxury-oriented benefits. Suitable for high net worth individuals, this card comes with a credit limit ranging from Rs. 1 lakh to Rs. 15 lakh (approx.). Its benefits majorly cater to the travel needs of the cardholders through 3% value-back as rewards, complimentary HoteLux membership and premium hospitality benefits at ITC Hotels. In addition to these travel savings, this PNB credit card also attempts to provide an effortless travel experience through a variety of services. Furthermore, this card also offers discounts on movie tickets and fast track immigration, accelerated rewards on dining spends, golf access, and others, thus covering a wide range of lifestyle categories. Read on to know more about the fees, features and benefits of PNB LUXURA RuPay Metal Credit Card.",
